-# reduces to a pure BACK-FACE count (the census shows `escaped` is 0.00 for every texel, so the al==0 term never fires
-# here). Joining a per-texel 7-probe census against the CPU's own 34,851-texel all-skip set:
-#     mean back-faces: CPU-skipped 4.79 of 7   |   CPU-kept 0.76 of 7
-#     back>=2 -> fires 20.56%, recall 80.1%, precision 10.9%
-#     back>=6 -> fires  2.63%, recall 57.4%, precision 60.9%   <- and the CPU itself fires 2.79%
