-# ***** v323 RAY COUNT: MATCH THE CPU EXACTLY (128 rays/call), do not 4x it.
-# args2 passes main=16 sec=8, which IS the CPU's SUPER preset (table entry 10 @0xA30A90: ssN=4,
-# sec=8, main=2*sec=16 -> 128 rays/call; confirmed by super2_run.log "main=16 sec=8 (128 rays/call)").
