-# regression to the mean. On a selection-free metric (per-chart means) the ratio is 0.9795 median and
-# every brightness decile is <= 1.0 -- we are slightly DARK, never 2x bright.
-# Matching the ray count makes the two bakes' sampling identical and cuts gather cost ~4x.
