+  Measured A/B on the v365 bake (farm_w15 atlas, 2026-09-29): truecolor + P8 pixel-identical to the SEVER=3 tool
+  write-back; the lightmap tag differs only in 386 of 8,682 vertex-lit (flags=3) records (tool visibility-RNG noise;
