+             scenery_bounds_db_md5 and is checked against the fix state the DLL observed in-process (check scnfix).
+    phase 2  derive_owner_table.py / build_objgrids.py read scenery_occ.bin. build_objgrids exit 4 (sidecar not this capture's)
+             THROWS; exit 2 keeps the 2026-10-04 v368o sky fallback, with a scenery-named Note on a scenery map (M3).
+    phase 3  fullgpu evaluates the scenery rows with the *_scn kernel set (per-section override, raw normals, CPU bias) ->
