+    # and r.e. search radius 0.5 where low writes 5,000,000 and 1.0 -- and baking super on low's values
+    # cost 0.34 pp (97.8661% -> 98.2058% when fixed). A sever=3 capture at super costs 131.9 s vs ~72 s at
