+    # the structure by BSP cluster (int16 item+0x1C, 0x49C332); on a pre-v359 capture the cyclotron-only corrected table
+    # v041-fullgpu\re_owner.bin is promoted when it applies (the promoter refuses any other capture). v356 measured it
+    # costs nothing (phase 3 383.6 s vs 384 s; the old "+32%" note below is stale). -OwnerSplit is accepted and changes
+    # nothing; -OwnerMerged reproduces the old merged default for A/B.
+    [switch]$OwnerSplit,
+    [switch]$OwnerMerged,
